%N A400702 Maximum number of distinct sums x + y <= n with x, y in S, over all floor(sqrt(n))-element subsets S of {1, ..., n}.
%C A400702 This is f(n) in Erdős Problem 819.
%H A400702 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A400702/b400702.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..150</a>
%H A400702 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/819">Erdős Problem 819</a>, Erdős Problems.
%F A400702 a(n-1) <= a(n) for n >= 2.
%F A400702 a(n) <= a(n-1) + 1 for nonsquare n >= 2.
%Y A400702 Cf. A003022.
%K A400702 nonn,new
